TI  - In Vitro-Selected DNA Aptamers Enable Detection of the Ancestral Peptide 3C8Y in [FeFe]-Hydrogenase CpI and in Metal-Rich, Acidic Environments: Implications for Astrobiology.
AU  - Blanco, Yolanda
AU  - Naskar, Shuvankar
AU  - Aguilera, Ángeles
AU  - Fernández-Algar, María
AU  - Happe, Thomas
