TI  - Bioremediation analysis of  sediment‐ microbial fuel cells for energy recovery from microbial activity in soil
AU  - Bose, Debajyoti
AU  - Santra, Mahula
AU  - Sanka, Rama Venkata Siva Prasanna
AU  - Krishnakumar, Balaji
PY  - 2020
JO  - International Journal of Energy Research
DO  - 10.1002/er.6163
