TI  - Reduction of O2 and NO in flavodiiron proteins - Tuning the energy landscape by second sphere ligation variations.
AU  - Blomberg, Margareta R A
AU  - Ädelroth, Pia
PY  - 2025
JO  - Journal of inorganic biochemistry
DO  - 10.1016/j.jinorgbio.2025.112943
