TI  - FNR-Type Regulator GoxR of the Obligatorily Aerobic Acetic Acid Bacterium Gluconobacter oxydans Affects Expression of Genes Involved in Respiration and Redox Metabolism.
AU  - Schweikert, Stefanie
AU  - Kranz, Angela
AU  - Yakushi, Toshiharu
