TI  - Oxygen induces the expression of invasion and stress response genes in the anaerobic salmon parasite Spironucleus salmonicida.
AU  - Stairs, Courtney W
AU  - Kokla, Anna
AU  - Ástvaldsson, Ásgeir
AU  - Jerlström-Hultqvist, Jon
AU  - Svärd, Staffan
AU  - Ettema, Thijs J G
