TI  - Mechanism of biochar in alleviating the inhibition of anaerobic digestion under ciprofloxacin press.
AU  - Yao, Bing
AU  - Liu, Min
AU  - Yu, Liqiang
AU  - Ni, Qianhan
AU  - Yuan, Changjie
AU  - Hu, Xuan
AU  - Feng, Haoran
