TI  - Biochemical characterization of a flavodiiron protein from bird parasite Histomonas meleagridis: superoxide as a reaction intermediate.
AU  - Munan, Subrata
AU  - Yoval-Sánchez, Belem
AU  - Yao, Canglin
AU  - Seravalli, Javier
AU  - Abdulaziz, Evana N
