TI  - New functions of pirin proteins and a 2‐ketoglutarate: Ferredoxin oxidoreductase ortholog in Bacteroides fragilis metabolism and their impact on antimicrobial susceptibility to metronidazole and amixicile
AU  - Andrea M. Gough
