TI  - Biochar mitigates the peatland GHG dilemma under contrasting water table regimes: phase-dependent responses of CO2 and CH4 over a two-year study.
AU  - Jeewani, Peduruhewa H
AU  - Rhymes, Jennifer M
AU  - Evans, Chris D
