TI  - Elite Cross-Country Skiers Develop Greater Physiological Adaptations Than Biathletes in Summer Macrocycle.
AU  - Feofilaktov, Victor V
AU  - Heil, Daniel
AU  - Myakinchenko, Evgeny B
AU  - Smith, Daniel M
AU  - Kruchkov, Andrey S
PY  - 2025
