TI  - Sedimentation rate and organic matter dynamics shape microbiomes across a continental margin
AU  - Sabyasachi Bhattacharya
AU  - Tarunendu Mapder
AU  - Svetlana Fernandes
AU  - Chayan Roy
AU  - Jagannath Sarkar
AU  - Moidu Jameela Rameez
