TI  - FeoC from Klebsiella pneumoniae contains a [4Fe-4S] cluster.
AU  - Hsueh, Kuang-Lung
AU  - Yu, Liang-Kun
AU  - Chen, Yung-Han
AU  - Cheng, Ya-Hsin
AU  - Hsieh, Yin-Cheng
