TI  - Dual-bioaugmentation strategy to simultaneously mitigate biofouling and promote methanogenesis in AnMBR.
AU  - Li, Yimeng
AU  - Yu, Huarong
AU  - Yang, Haiyang
AU  - Wan, Yuxuan
AU  - Pan, Zhihui
