TI  - Chlamydomonas reinhardtii chloroplasts contain a homodimeric pyruvate:ferredoxin oxidoreductase that functions with FDX1.
AU  - van Lis, Robert
AU  - Baffert, Carole
AU  - Couté, Yohann
AU  - Nitschke, Wolfgang
AU  - Atteia, Ariane
PY  - 2013
JO  - Plant physiology
