TI  - Pseudomonas aeruginosa Exhibits Deficient Biofilm Formation in the Absence of Class II and III Ribonucleotide Reductases Due to Hindered Anaerobic Growth.
AU  - Crespo, Anna
AU  - Pedraz, Lucas
AU  - Astola, Josep
AU  - Torrents, Eduard
