TI  - Cardiopulmonary Exercise Testing in Critically Ill Coronavirus Disease 2019 Survivors: Evidence of a Sustained Exercise Intolerance and Hypermetabolism.
AU  - Joris, Maurice
AU  - Minguet, Pauline
AU  - Colson, Camille
AU  - Joris, Jean
AU  - Fadeur, Marjorie
AU  - Minguet, Gregory
