TI  - Fumarate reductase is a major contributor to the generation of reactive oxygen species in the anaerobe Bacteroides fragilis.
AU  - Meehan, Brian M
AU  - Malamy, Michael H
PY  - 2012
JO  - Microbiology (Reading, England)
DO  - 10.1099/mic.0.054403-0
AN  - 22075026
