TI  - Genome-guided analysis of physiological capacities of Tepidanaerobacter acetatoxydans provides insights into environmental adaptations and syntrophic acetate oxidation.
AU  - Müller, Bettina
AU  - Manzoor, Shahid
AU  - Niazi, Adnan
AU  - Bongcam-Rudloff, Erik
AU  - Schnürer, Anna
PY  - 2015
