TI  - Anaerobic Formate and Hydrogen Metabolism.
AU  - Pinske, Constanze
AU  - Sawers, R Gary
PY  - 2016
JO  - EcoSal Plus
DO  - 10.1128/ecosalplus.esp-0011-2016
AN  - 27735784
