TI  - Response of methanogenic system to long-term polycyclic aromatic hydrocarbon exposure: Adsorption and biodegradation, performance variation, and microbial function assessment.
AU  - Shi, Yongsen
AU  - Xue, Hanhan
AU  - Li, Jingyi
AU  - Yao, Yilin
AU  - Liu, Rutao
AU  - Niu, Qigui
PY  - 2023
