TI  - Online recovery of reversible degradation in oxygen-enriched proton exchange membrane fuel cells via high-current-density pulse: Mechanism decoupling and optimization
AU  - Zhang, Xiyuan
AU  - He, Lian
AU  - Xu, Liangfei
AU  - Gan, Quanquan
AU  - Hu, Zunyan
AU  - Li, Jianqiu
AU  - Ouyang, Minggao
