TI  - Novel transcriptional regulator OxtR1 regulates potential ferrodoxin in response to oxygen stress in Treponema denticola.
AU  - Numata, Yumi
AU  - Kikuchi, Yuichiro
AU  - Sato, Toru
AU  - Okamoto-Shibayama, Kazuko
AU  - Ando, Yutaro
AU  - Miyai-Murai, Yuri
AU  - Kokubu, Eitoyo
AU  - Ishihara, Kazuyuki
