TI  - Iron limitation indirectly reduces the Escherichia coli torCAD operon expression by a reduction of molybdenum cofactor availability.
AU  - Hasnat, Muhammad Abrar
AU  - Zupok, Arkadiusz
AU  - Gorka, Michal
AU  - Iobbi-Nivol, Chantal
AU  - Skirycz, Aleksandra
AU  - Jourlin-Castelli, Cécile
