TI  - A rubrerythrin locus of Clostridioides difficile encodes enzymes that efficiently detoxify reactive oxygen species.
AU  - Knop, Robert
AU  - Keweloh, Simon
AU  - Pukall, Johanna
AU  - Dittmann, Silvia
AU  - Zühlke, Daniela
AU  - Sievers, Susanne
PY  - 2025
