TI  - Oxidative Stress as an Underlying Mechanism of Bacteria-Inflicted Damage to Male Gametes
AU  - Tvrdá, Eva
AU  - Benko, Filip
AU  - Ďuračka, Michal
PY  - 2022
JO  - Oxygen
DO  - 10.3390/oxygen2040036
