TI  - Defense arsenal of the strict anaerobe Clostridioides difficile against reactive oxygen species encountered during its infection cycle.
AU  - Lotoux, Aurélie
AU  - Caulat, Léo
AU  - Martins Alves, Catarina
AU  - Alves Feliciano, Carolina
AU  - Morvan, Claire
AU  - Folgosa, Filipe
AU  - Martin-Verstraete, Isabelle
