TI  - Impacts of perR on oxygen sensitivity, gene expression, and murine infection in Clostridioides difficile 630Δerm.
AU  - Gregory, Anna L
AU  - Bussan, Hailey E
AU  - Topf, Madeline A
AU  - Hryckowian, Andrew J
