TI  - Sustainable restoration of anoxic freshwater using environmentally-compatible oxygen-carrying biochar: Performance and mechanisms.
AU  - Li, Yi
AU  - Xiong, Xinyan
AU  - Zhang, Chi
AU  - Liu, An
PY  - 2022
JO  - Water research
DO  - 10.1016/j.watres.2022.118204
