TI  - Long-term functional recovery and associated microbial community structure after sediment drying and bedform migration
AU  - Oprei, Anna
AU  - Schreckinger, José
AU  - Kholiavko, Tatiana
AU  - Frossard, Aline
AU  - Mutz, Michael
AU  - Risse-Buhl, Ute
