TI  - The Role of the [2Fe-2S] Cluster of Escherichia coli IscR in Responding to Redox-Cycling Agents.
AU  - Banerjee, Rajdeep
AU  - Mettert, Erin L
AU  - Fleischhacker, Angela S
AU  - Kiley, Patricia J
PY  - 2025
JO  - Molecular microbiology
DO  - 10.1111/mmi.70021
