TI  - Crohn's Disease Differentially Affects Region-Specific Composition and Aerotolerance Profiles of Mucosally Adherent Bacteria.
AU  - Shahir, Nur M
AU  - Wang, Jeremy R
AU  - Wolber, E Ashley
AU  - Schaner, Matthew S
AU  - Frank, Daniel N
AU  - Ir, Diana
