TI  - NADPH-Driven Organohalide Reduction by a Nonrespiratory Reductive Dehalogenase.
AU  - Collins, Fraser A
AU  - Fisher, Karl
AU  - Payne, Karl A P
AU  - Gaytan Mondragon, Samantha
AU  - Rigby, Stephen E J
AU  - Leys, David
