TI  - Sub- and supercritical water oxidation of anaerobic fermentation sludge for carbon and nitrogen recovery in a regenerative life support system
AU  - Zhang, Dongdong
AU  - Clauwaert, Peter
AU  - Luther, Amanda
AU  - López Barreiro, Diego
AU  - Prins, Wolter
AU  - (Wim) Brilman, D.W.F.
