TI  - The effectiveness of pH adjustment and controlled oxygen injection to enhance acidogenic performance in two stage anaerobic digestion
AU  - Damayanti, Sri Ismiyati
AU  - Sarto
AU  - Astiti, Dian Fitriani
AU  - Budhijanto, Wiratni
PY  - 2019
