TI  - Metagenome metabolic analysis revealing the mechanism of simultaneous methanogenesis, aerobic methane oxidation and denitrification ( SMAMOD ) in a microaerobic up‐flow sludge bed biofilm reactor
AU  - Xin, Zhou
AU  - Zeyang, Yin
AU  - Daling, Ge
AU  - Gonglei, Wang
