TI  - Sensor‐mediated granular sludge reactor for nitrogen removal and reduced aeration demand using a dilute wastewater
AU  - Bekele, Zerihun A.
AU  - Delgado Vela, Jeseth
AU  - Bott, Charles B.
AU  - Love, Nancy G.
PY  - 2020
JO  - Water Environment Research
DO  - 10.1002/wer.1296
