TI  - Effects of micro-aeration on microbial niches and antimicrobial resistances in blackwater anaerobic digesters
AU  - Guo, Bing
AU  - Yu, Najiaowa
AU  - Weissbrodt, David G.
AU  - Liu, Yang
PY  - 2021
JO  - Water Research
DO  - 10.1016/j.watres.2021.117035
