TI  - Identifying the mechanisms of sludge reduction in the sulfidogenic oxic-settling anaerobic (SOSA) process: Side-stream sulfidogenesis-intensified sludge decay and mainstream extended aeration
AU  - Huang, Hao
AU  - Ekama, George
AU  - Deng, Yang-Fan
AU  - Chen, Guang-Hao
AU  - Wu, Di
PY  - 2021
JO  - Water Research
DO  - 10.1016/j.watres.2020.116608
