TI  - Augmented methanogenic performance in straw-manure co-digestion via micro/nano bubble-enhanced syntrophic metabolism
AU  - Hou, Yanning
AU  - Liu, Chao
AU  - Wei, Jianhong
AU  - Zhao, Wenyan
