TI  - Emerging materials and pretreatment strategies in anaerobic digestion for biogas production: A review on recent advances, limitations, and future perspectives
AU  - Sangubotla, Roopkumar
AU  - Gedda, Gangaraju
AU  - Kim, Jongsung
AU  - Pang, Myung-Geol
