TI  - Study on the growth and decline patterns and environmental drivers of pathogens during the stabilization process of simulated landfilling municipal solid waste
AU  - Shen, Dongsheng
AU  - Su, Liya
AU  - Ding, Hening
AU  - Long, Yuyang
AU  - Hui, Cai
