TI  - Sustainable management of simulated coffee processing wastewater using micro-aeration enhanced anaerobic digestion: a long-term technical evaluation
AU  - Taiwo, Kayode J.
AU  - Ogundipe, Samuel O.
AU  - Kerr, William L.
AU  - Pegg, Ronald B.
AU  - Suh, Joon Hyuk
AU  - Usack, Joseph G.
