TI  - Can microaeration and hydraulic retention time steer anaerobic microbiomes toward efficient linear alkylbenzene sulfonate degradation?
AU  - de Oliveira, Maurício Guimarães
AU  - Porfiro Sales Gonçalves da Silva, Vicente Elício
AU  - Ferreira Vasconcelos, Steven Renato
AU  - Milen Firmino, Paulo Igor
AU  - dos Santos, André Bezerra
