TI  - Alleviation of ammonia inhibition via nano-bubble water supplementation during anaerobic digestion of ammonia-rich swine manure: Buffering capacity promotion and methane production enhancement
AU  - Fan, Yujie
AU  - Yang, Xiaojing
AU  - Lei, Zhongfang
AU  - Zhang, Zhenya
AU  - Kobayashi, Motoyoshi
AU  - Adachi, Yasuhisa
